# IMPORT PLUGIN - a data set the import API accepts
#
#        one defined method is mandatory:
#        - Import(json_data)   returns <True|False>,"message"
#
# Loaded by the name the API was asked for, e.g. plugins/import/prometheus_rules.py,
# and only when that name is listed in ALLOWED_IMPORTERS under [PLUGINS] in
# luna.ini. There is no search path and no default.
